    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Last Toast is a first-person adventure set in a Venetian villa owned by the Bepi's family.<br><br>You awaken in the chilling silence of a ballroom, surrounded by the deceased guests of the  family's latest celebration. Just hours ago, you raised a glass to their new wine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the opulent Venetian villa is a tomb, strangled by monstrous vines visible beyond the windows, and haunted by a sinister force within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As perhaps the only survivor, your primary goal is to make it out alive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Fight, Survive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find your way through the handcrafted Villa hallways, in an attempt to reach its very core.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the items you need to progress through the estate\u2019s locked doors and hidden passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle nightmarish creatures with scavenged weapons, from melee to firearms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the impact of every hit with dynamic, physics-based reactions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive: ammo is scarce and bullets should not be wasted.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639210/extras/82f48e19e008894a101fc6ea0ee1b8be.poster.webp?t=1752248722\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639210/extras/82f48e19e008894a101fc6ea0ee1b8be.webp?t=1752248722\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Last Toast is a first-person adventure set in a Venetian villa owned by the Bepi's family.<br><br>You awaken in the chilling silence of a ballroom, surrounded by the deceased guests of the  family's latest celebration. Just hours ago, you raised a glass to their new wine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the opulent Venetian villa is a tomb, strangled by monstrous vines visible beyond the windows, and haunted by a sinister force within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As perhaps the only survivor, your primary goal is to make it out alive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Fight, Survive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find your way through the handcrafted Villa hallways, in an attempt to reach its very core.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the items you need to progress through the estate\u2019s locked doors and hidden passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle nightmarish creatures with scavenged weapons, from melee to firearms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the impact of every hit with dynamic, physics-based reactions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive: ammo is scarce and bullets should not be wasted.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639210/extras/82f48e19e008894a101fc6ea0ee1b8be.poster.webp?t=1752248722\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639210/extras/82f48e19e008894a101fc6ea0ee1b8be.webp?t=1752248722\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
